  "slug": "food-temperature-checklist-form",
  "title": "Food Temperature Checklist Form",
  "subtitle": "A practical execution checklist for food temperature that connects identity, observations and evidence, decision authority, exception ownership, and accountable closeout.",
  "description": "An original retail-operations execution checklist for food temperature covering temperature reading and product disposition, evidence references, authorization, escalation, operating limits, disposition, and handoff without copying a third-party form.",
  "use_case": "Use when a food operations lead opens one food temperature record to execute required steps, record conditions, route exceptions, make a release decision, and hand off open work; closure requires a documented outcome, evidence route, responsible owner, and recipient acknowledgment.",
  "risk_tier": "B",
